{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/5e0b7f6d75b8574a7566a5c3bc854853.avif?t=1774440956\" width=730 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deluge</strong> is a dark, story-rich RPG about memory, morality, and the undead. You play as a resurrected soldier bound to serve a tyrant who once destroyed your home. As Ganglim returns to crush the last remnants of resistance, you infiltrate a rebuilt village\u2014only to find yourself haunted by the life you left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town of Figaro, a place shaped by grief, art, and its fractured community. Engage in tense, turn-based battles against ghouls, demons, and twisted remnants of the past. Navigate branching decisions, a developing conscience, and meaningful choices that shape your role in a world trying desperately to heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you carry out your orders, or remember who you were?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/7a110943c9d96910108c5703c60b0883.webp?t=1774440956\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven RPG about memory, morality, and the undead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a reanimated corpse serving the tyrant who destroyed your home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the grief-stricken village of Figaro, full of secrets and a hidden past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional turn-based combat, emphasizing strategy and experimentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions impact how the world sees you\u2014and how you see yourself</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/7a110943c9d96910108c5703c60b0883.webp?t=1774440956\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/6ff434d2a884f0c05e6303c4bb510bbf.avif?t=1774440956\" width=730 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer's note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Originally released on October 31, 2021, <strong>DELUGE</strong> was my first RPG Maker passion project. This upcoming reinvention of the original release upgrades every facet of the game and re-introduces the tale of Hudson, Ganglim and the village of Figaro with a variety of quality-of-life upgrades, enhanced storylines and an abundance of new content to uncover.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/d3318eb24082d4f907ef2e992aeb254a.avif?t=1774440956\" width=600 height=212 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3779440?t=1774440956","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3779440?t=1774440956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/60340d3951c23a0e1c49d8ec9e014fb7a5ec2fba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774440956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/60340d3951c23a0e1c49d8ec9e014fb7a5ec2fba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774440956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed 